<p>Kenya&#x27;s Sabastian Sawe became the first man to run a marathon in under two hours in an official competitive race, winning the London Marathon in 1:59:30 on April 26. AP reported that Ethiopia&#x27;s Yomif Kejelcha also finished under two hours, making them the first two people to do so in a marathon recognized as a competition rather than an exhibition. Sawe&#x27;s result lowered the men&#x27;s world record by 65 seconds. The same race brought another milestone on the women&#x27;s side, as Ethiopia&#x27;s Tigst Assefa set a women-only marathon world record of 2:15:41.</p><h3>Highlights:</h3><ul><li>Second sub-two: Yomif Kejelcha joined Sawe under the two-hour mark in London. AP reported that he and Sawe became the first two people to do it in a competitive marathon race.</li><li>Women&#x27;s milestone: Tigst Assefa set a women-only marathon world record of 2:15:41 in the same event.</li><li>Competitive context: Semafor described Sawe&#x27;s run as the first sub-two-hour marathon in a competitive race, which sets it apart from earlier specially staged attempts.</li><li>Global attention: The achievement drew international coverage from outlets including Al Jazeera, France 24, and AP.</li></ul><h3>Perspectives:</h3><ul><li>Associated Press: AP reported that Sawe set a world record of 1:59:30, that Yomif Kejelcha also ran under two hours, and that Tigst Assefa set a women-only marathon world record. (<a href='https://apnews.com/article/marathon-record-sawe-london-under-two-hours-8481a99809f19e0dd2cafca36bd3676a'>Associated Press</a>)</li><li>Semafor: Semafor reported that Sawe became the first athlete to run a marathon in under two hours in a competitive race. (<a href='https://www.semafor.com/article/04/26/2026/kenyas-sawe-breaks-2-hour-marathon-record'>Semafor</a>)</li><li>Al Jazeera: Al Jazeera reported that Sawe shattered the two-hour marathon barrier at the London Marathon. (<a href='https://www.aljazeera.com/video/newsfeed/2026/4/26/kenyas-sawe-shatters-two-hour-marathon-barrier'>Al Jazeera</a>)</li></ul><h3>Sources:</h3><ul><li><a href='https://www.reddit.com/r/UpliftingNews/comments/1swdm0z/sabastian_sawe_breaks_fabled_2hour_barrier_in_the/'>Sabastian Sawe breaks fabled 2-hour barrier in the marathon to shatter world record by 65 seconds</a> - reddit.com</li><li><a href='https://www.aljazeera.com/video/newsfeed/2026/4/26/kenyas-sawe-shatters-two-hour-marathon-barrier'>Kenya’s Sawe shatters two-hour marathon barrier</a> - aljazeera.com</li><li><a href='https://www.youtube.com/watch'>Kenya&#x27;s Sabastian Sawe, first man to run a marathon in under two hours • FRANCE 24 English</a> - youtube.com</li><li><a href='https://www.semafor.com/article/04/26/2026/kenyas-sawe-breaks-2-hour-marathon-record'>Kenya&#x27;s Sawe breaks 2-hour marathon record</a> - semafor.com</li><li><a href='https://apnews.com/article/marathon-record-sawe-london-under-two-hours-8481a99809f19e0dd2cafca36bd3676a'>Sabastian Sawe and Yomif Kejelcha become the first people to run a marathon in under two hours, with Sawe setting a new world record of 1:59:30. Tigst Assefa also sets a new world record for a women-only marathon at 2:15:41.</a> - apnews.com</li></ul>